 when proxy_connector_http_status_code enabled
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Previously, ApiEvent always logged status_code=200 for JsonWithHeaders responses,
even when the actual HTTP response had a different status code from the connector.
This caused data pipeline inconsistencies.

Changes:
- Add extract_connector_http_status_code() helper function
- Extract connector status code in server_wrap_util() before logging ApiEvent
- Refactor server_wrap() to use the helper function (removes code duplication)

